Hi-
  I just want to comment that the bag of holding trick does in fact
allow one to carry boulders.  In fact, in one game that I played for
academic reasons, I would routinely carry hundreds of boulders at
once.  If you try this sort of stuff at home, remember that it is 
important to try to keep your total weight at a small, positive value.
In general try to stay within a boulder-weight of your maximum
carrying capacity.

